ATTRIBUTION FOR INCLUDED COMPONENTS:

RippleMap AI incorporates the following open-source projects:

1. OpenStreetMap Data (ODbL 1.0)
   - Used for road network data
   - https://www.openstreetmap.org/copyright

2. FastAPI (MIT License)
   - Web framework for backend API
   - https://fastapi.tiangolo.com/

3. React & React Router (MIT License)
   - Frontend UI framework and routing
   - https://react.dev/

4. Leaflet (BSD 2-Clause License)
   - Interactive map library
   - https://leafletjs.com/

5. NetworkX (BSD 3-Clause License)
   - Graph algorithms for network analysis
   - https://networkx.org/

6. GeoPandas (BSD 3-Clause License)
   - Geospatial data manipulation
   - https://geopandas.org/

7. PostGIS (GNU General Public License v2.0)
   - PostgreSQL spatial extension
   - https://postgis.net/

Please see individual component licenses for full details.
